{
  "name": "Weekly marketing recap email from your results sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                5
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 14
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "062880a8-fd5e-5cf3-bb3f-e17b4159f71b",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Marketing\",\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"business_name\": \"Your Business\",\n    \"sender_name\": \"Your Name\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8cea0d8-57e7-59d8-9172-43e7b0a64f1a",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ea84656d-0ea1-5dcb-adc0-f98428a75a12",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nconst rows = $input.all().map((i) => i.json).filter((r) => (true)).slice(0, 150);\nconst text = rows.map((r) => Object.entries(r).filter(([k]) => k !== 'row_number').map(([k, v]) => k + ': ' + v).join(' | ')).join('\\n');\nreturn [{ json: { count: rows.length, rows_text: text || 'No rows.' } }];"
      },
      "id": "dd7b638a-1364-51b9-9022-5e4c1d1fcc91",
      "name": "Prepare the rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a marketing analyst for a small business. From these rows give the best and worst channel by cost per lead, any trend, and one thing to repeat and one to stop next week.\n\nNumber of rows: {{ $json.count }}\nRows:\n{{ $json.rows_text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "a7ccbf6a-6464-5af8-b6a4-ade41e66b69d",
      "name": "AI: write the summary",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a3dcf2a-4371-5cad-8398-224fbb40b620",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"headline\": \"Short subject line\",\n  \"summary\": \"Two or three sentences.\",\n  \"actions\": \"- First action\\n- Second action\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "8d5db5e4-4f66-5426-ad52-c7c005b85635",
      "name": "AI output format",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1160,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.owner_email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.output.headline }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.output.summary }}\n\nWhat to do next:\n{{ $json.output.actions }}\n\n(Based on {{ $('Prepare the rows').first().json.count }} rows from your sheet.)",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "8e891c04-2edf-5e3c-9fa6-d400ea5f71ae",
      "name": "Email the summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly marketing recap email from your results sheet\nEach Friday summarises your marketing numbers (leads, clicks, spend) and recommends what to repeat or stop.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d154c89a-b51f-5bc0-948e-d2ce7ee99098",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Marketing** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and the email that should receive the summary.\n3. Connect Google Sheets, Gmail and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. Run once by hand to see the email, then switch the workflow to **Active** (it runs on the schedule in the first node).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "42f561f3-b70b-5996-bba8-661835dee092",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -400
      ]
    }
